WEBVTT

00:08:28.156 --> 00:08:30.236
and can share their own stories

00:08:30.276 --> 00:08:36.356
to help to really ground some
of these concepts and real experiences.

00:08:36.396 --> 00:08:39.116
So why don't we turn things over?

00:08:39.116 --> 00:08:42.356
We have our first guest joining us, Gina.

00:08:42.676 --> 00:08:44.956
So I'll leave you and Gina to have a chat.

00:08:44.956 --> 00:08:47.156
DP: I'm really excited
to have you here, Gina.

00:08:47.156 --> 00:08:50.316
I think the question I want to ask you,
and then we'll unpack this,

00:08:50.356 --> 00:08:51.796
is just can you share a story

00:08:51.836 --> 00:08:54.716
of when you didn't feel powerful
as a woman of color at work?

00:08:54.716 --> 00:08:57.396
And then we'll talk about what
else we could do around it

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.516
and what else we hope to learn from it.

00:08:59.556 --> 00:09:01.196
Gina: Throughout my entire career,